# 783: remaining platform singles (module platform).
#absorbed vcx/platform/io_watch_test.v
#absorbed vcx/platform/live_refs_feed_test.v
#absorbed vcx/platform/serve_file_fastpath_test.v
#absorbed vcx/platform/sql_test.v
#absorbed vcx/platform/xap_dist_exports_identity_test.v
#absorbed vcx/platform/xap_log_reduce_test.v
#
# ── #1012, 2026-08-26: the rows above were folded in by `apply`, which
# (unlike `absorb`) never rewrote the manifest — so they sat here as LIVE
# rows naming originals that were removed at the merge. Marked as the
# history they always were. Absorption is one-way: the umbrella owns
# these bodies, and any fix made to the umbrella since exists only there.
# Restoring an original to regenerate is refused by name —
# `scripts/consolidate_tests.sh audit <area>`.
#
# ── RS-24 (#1591, owner D28a), 2026-09-23: the serve_file_fastpath_test.v and
# sql_test.v sections left this umbrella with their products for
# vcx/cxnet/cxnet_test.v and vcx/cxdb/cxdb_test.v, in-module there (the first
# byte-for-byte; the second with store_str, the store family's helper, spelled as
# the cx.mk_string it wraps, since db does not pin store). The rows
# above stay the history they are.
#
# ── RS-24, xap's split, 2026-09-23: the xap_dist_exports_identity_test.v and
# xap_log_reduce_test.v sections left this umbrella with xap for
# vcx/xap/xap_test.v, in-module there, byte-for-byte; io_watch_test.v went
# back to module code as vcx/code/io_watch_behavior_test.v (it tests Ring 1
# alone), and the #705 content-type pins to vcx/cxnet/cxnet_test.v. The
# rows above stay the history they are.
#
# ── RS-24, the store's split: the live_refs_feed_test.v section left this umbrella
# with its product for vcx/store/store_test.v, in-module there (its local
# `store` spelled `store_node`, which V requires inside a module of that name).
# ── Both splits merged (store, then xap), 2026-09-23: every section has its
# product's home and platform_misc_umbrella_test.v is gone; the rows above are
# history only.
